<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07381b 0%, #0d562b 100%); color: #fff; padding: 60px 0;">
  <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
    <span class="hero-badge" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">Cutting-Edge Audiological Solutions</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; color: #fff;">
      Modern Hearing Aids for a Modern World
    </h1>
    <p style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: #d1fae5; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      Discreet, intelligent, mini supercomputers engineered to deliver crystal-clear audio, reduce cognitive fatigue, and restore your connection to the sounds you cherish most.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Transforming Quality of Life -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Life Transformation</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Transforming Quality of Life</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Discover the profound everyday benefits of addressing hearing loss with digital technology.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">❤️</div>
        <h3>Stronger Relationships</h3>
        <p>Effortlessly engage in conversations without asking family or friends to repeat themselves. Reconnect with warmth, humor, and emotional nuances.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">🧠</div>
        <h3>Reduced Mental Fatigue</h3>
        <p>Straining to hear forces the brain to expend immense cognitive energy. Modern hearing aids take the load off your brain, leaving you energized throughout the day.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">🎯</div>
        <h3>Selective Clarity</h3>
        <p>Directional beamforming microphones zero in on the voice directly in front of you while intelligently suppressing background chatter in crowded restaurants.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">☕</div>
        <h3>Discreet as a Coffee Bean</h3>
        <p>Today's custom in-the-canal instruments sit completely hidden inside the ear canal, making them practically invisible to onlookers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">📱</div>
        <h3>Seamless Bluetooth Streaming</h3>
        <p>Stream phone calls, YouTube videos, and music straight from your Android or iPhone directly into both ears with pristine stereo clarity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-box">⚡</div>
        <h3>All-Day Rechargeable</h3>
        <p>Forget changing tiny batteries. Overnight inductive charging delivers up to 24+ hours of uninterrupted hearing power on a single charge.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What Makes a Modern Hearing Aid -->
<section class="section section-bg-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Inside the Technology</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What Makes a Modern Hearing Aid?</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Miniature precision engineering working in harmony thousands of times per second.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px;">
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Directional Microphones</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">Capture acoustic sound waves from your environment with multi-directional phase sensitivity.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. DSP Computer Chip</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">Analyzes 64+ sound channels, suppressing wind and background noise while amplifying soft speech consonants.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Miniature Receiver</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">Transmits the refined, frequency-balanced electrical signal into crisp sound waves deep into the ear canal.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Rechargeable &amp; Smart</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">Lithium-ion cells provide stable voltage, remote smartphone app control, and automatic acoustic scene switching.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

